   "tips": [
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "XP check: without Call of Fire (Shaman only, about 3,200 XP) other classes arrive here at about 12.0 with almost nothing to spare. That's why training is at the end of this stop, after the hand-ins. The playtest Shaman was already 12 from the northern hollows.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/liviu-stefan-pit/the-forever-project/blob/main/research/playtests/zephras-isle-plan.md",
       "label": "Playtest 2026-11-27 (Shaman 9-14, AdventureLog)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": true
    },
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "The playtest reached level 13 on the last Ealaane hand-in. Ealaane is at the east end, and A Firm Response sends you north from there.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/liviu-stefan-pit/the-forever-project/blob/main/research/playtests/zephras-isle-plan.md",
       "label": "Playtest 2026-11-27 (Shaman 9-14, AdventureLog)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": true
    },
    {
     "kind": "general",
     "text": "Crab Season gives Recipe: Pincer Bites (Cooking). Nyalah's trainer window had nothing new at levels 9 and 12. The playtest spent about 4 minutes crafting next to her (Leatherworking 39 to 49, First Aid 32 to 44). That's a Balanced choice; Speedrun just hands in and moves on.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/liviu-stefan-pit/the-forever-project/blob/main/research/playtests/zephras-isle-plan.md",
       "label": "Playtest 2026-11-27 (Shaman 9-14, AdventureLog)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": true
    }
