  {
   "id": "zephras-isle:leave-zephras-balanced",
   "tags": {},
   "text": [
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Balanced: leave Zephras Isle here, at about level 13. Take the skycutter from the dock in Valanaar to Mulgore (no quest needed)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Then run east out of Mulgore to the Crossroads and continue with The Barrens 12-20 (Horde). Skip its first step: Conscript of the Horde starts in Razor Hill."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Want the island's whole story? Keep going with the Extended steps below, up to The Earthen Ring from Ayessa Dawnsinger. In the playtest that took about 70 minutes for about 14,600 XP and ended at level 14."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
